41	8	2	TT-210728 - Eric McGinty (Bill)	&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;Eric McGinty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;12320 Manzanita Lane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;Glen Ellen, CA 95442&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;eric@envivid.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;(415) 902-9137&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;___________________________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;Eric wanted port forwards for his cameras&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;1.) Public alias IP on hapi,&amp;nbsp;66.160.182.108&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;2.) Binat rule on Hapi /etc/pf.conf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;#Eric McGinty cpe -al 7.27.2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; pass quick on em0 from 100.64.17.242 to any binat-to 66.160.182.108&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Block rules in hapi /etc/pf.conf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;#Block ssh and web to BH2.AP.CPE-Mcginty.Relay (100.64.17.242) bi-nat -ir 7-&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 27-2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;block in quick on em0 proto tcp to 66.160.182.108 port 22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;block in quick on em0 proto tcp to 66.160.182.108 port 80&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;block in quick on em0 proto tcp to 66.160.182.108 port 443&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;3.) Port Forwards on CPE&amp;nbsp;100.64.17.242&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;1) 37777 &amp;gt; 37777 = 192.168.20.101&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;2) 37778 &amp;gt; 37778 = 192.168.20.101&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;3) 37779 &amp;gt; 37779 = 192.168.20.101&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;4) 37780 &amp;gt; 37780&amp;nbsp;= 192.168.20.101&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;5) 37781 &amp;gt; 37781&amp;nbsp;= 192.168.20.101&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="font