10	7	2	SR-210712 - Marlene Soiland (4503 trenton rd Santa Rosa)	&lt;p&gt;Marlene&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Soiland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4503&amp;nbsp;trenton&amp;nbsp;road&lt;br&gt;Santa&amp;nbsp;Rosa, CA 95409&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;marlene@soilandmgt.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marlene&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Soiland - 707&amp;nbsp;525&amp;nbsp;1100 - cell:&amp;nbsp;707-529-7111&lt;br&gt;Mark Stanley - 322-2343&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Site Survey:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Checked he address, she has visibility through to shiloh-x1, tv-relay, possibly even RWH2.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-JM 07.12.21021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- - - -&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Reached out to Marlene and scheduled to be installed on the thursday afternoon (12-1pm). We'll be meeting her husband Mark Stanley.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to send out Base proposal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Emailed Marlene and rescheduled her install for 11am.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Jm 07.15.2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* because of the outage we did not get to install Marlene's service today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Left VM and emailed Marlene regarding the outage and need to reschedule her email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Pending a call or message back for Marlene, if we dont hear back by monday lets reach out to her again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-JM 07/16/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Installation Scheduled:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Tue 7/20/2021 @ 1-2pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kevin ( 7-19-2021 )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;cpe-Marlene.Soiland = 10.77.10.80&amp;nbsp; (Connecting to 10.77.4.1) . -63dBm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Install took 1.5 hr&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kayla Billing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;cpe install = $299&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;discounting $200 for rescheduling twice&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;bill = $99&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monthly service fee = $80: starting 8/1/21 per Kevin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-JM 07/23/21&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rich is going out today, 7/20/2021, for the CPE install.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Google maps has wrong directions for 4503&amp;nbsp;trenton, stay on trenton road not trenton-healdsburg&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ubiquity and netgear WiFi networks are overlapping and interfering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ubiquity is interfering with the signal we are bringing the service in on&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;we need to:&lt;/b&gt; Provide a quote for adjusting their wifi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) remove netgear&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2) install managed switch and puck&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3) adopt their ubiquity WAPs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4) adjust channels&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;JM 7/20/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Reaching out to Mike and Marlene, emailing a quote:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) TrendNet Switch (@ $65/ea): &lt;b&gt;$65&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(1) UniFi AP AC LR ( @ $150/ea): &lt;b&gt;$150&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(1-3) Hours of Labor (@ $110/hr): &lt;b&gt;$110 - $330&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Estimated Total: &lt;b&gt;$325 - $545&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scheduling for possibly this afternoon or tommorow&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AL 7.22.2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;WiFi LAN Installation Scheduled:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Fri 7/23/2021 @ 9-10am&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AL 2.23.2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Summary of the work done 7/23/21&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Put in two new pucks. Adopted the original two pucks onto our controller. Cleaned up the channels. Put in trendnet switch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Kayla Billing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hours of labor (@110/hr) = 3hrs $330&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(2) unify AP AC LR (@150/ea) = $300&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) Trendnet switch (@65/ea)= $65&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;monthly service&amp;nbsp; = $80.00 starting August 1.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp; AL 7/23/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ToDo:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Need to create management net for the AP's put in on 7/23/21 and assign static IP's to them ()&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Update Nagios with CPE and AP's ()&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;* Rich had informed me that Mark had not been sent the bill for the following since the Installation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Kayla Billing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;cpe install = $299&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;discounting $200 for rescheduling twice&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;bill = $99&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monthly service fee = $80: starting 8/1/21 per Kevin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JM 07/23/21&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;---------------------&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Billing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(3) Hours of labor&amp;nbsp;(@110/hr)&lt;b&gt;$330&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(2) unify AP AC LR (@150/ea) = &lt;b&gt;$300&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) Trendnet switch (@65/ea)= &lt;b&gt;$65&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;monthly service&amp;nbsp; = $80.00 starting August 1.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- AL 7/23/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--------------------&lt;/p&gt