295	5	2	BILL-220311 - Pat Bransford - (2260 Los Alamos Rd. Santa Rosa) - OLD BILL 2018-2019	&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Billing summary of Pat Bransford Project from 2018 - 2019&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Service Call Performed on 10-2-18 Duplicated from this ticket [https://webcollab.rhinobee.com/tasks.php?x=0&amp;amp;action=show&amp;amp;taskid=2384]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.) (1)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"&gt;IC Realtime Dome Cameras (@ $175 ea.) = &lt;b&gt;$175&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;2.) (1) Unify AP (@ $150 ea.) (to serve trailer and tenants) = &lt;b&gt;$150&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3.) (1) Metal NEMA, w/ standard UPS (@ $175 ea.) (basement) = &lt;b&gt;$175&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;4.) (1) Group 24 Deep Cycle Battery (150/ea) =&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;$150&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;5.) (2) Netonix WS-6-mini (@ $175 ea.) = &lt;b&gt;$350&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6.) (1) HikVision NVR = &lt;b&gt;$1150&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;7.) (2) NBe5AC-19 (@ $120 ea) = &lt;b&gt;$240&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;8.) (6.5) Hours Labor (@ $90 p/hour) = &lt;b&gt;$585&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note: Installed NVR, installed ST at shed, and an AP for trailer, and battery back-up box in basement, labor includes measurements for conduit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;TOTAL = $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;2,975&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Running Total = $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;2,975&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- MS (10-8-18)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Service Call Performed on 10-9-18&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.) (1)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"&gt;IC Realtime Dome Cameras&amp;nbsp;(second camera on shed) = &lt;b&gt;$175&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;2.) (2) Hours Labor = (@ $90 p/hour) = &lt;b&gt;$180&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt