t;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;1 hr labor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre; font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;-JM 08/31/21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre; font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;_______________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;*Rich took the poe injector and powered it off another outlet, confirmed the PoE inject was working off the outlet. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;*Toby informed Rich his tv was not working. Rich found a savant box control controlling the tv powered off the watt-box, it had no power.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;*Rich provided an extension cable to power the savant box. Toby tried the TV again but it still was not working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;*Ramiro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;the AV tech, will need to troubleshoot the savant box, it does have power now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;*Pending call from Ramiro to Toby. Rich left his a vm requesting he call Toby back today. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p