132	8	2	TT-210915 - John Huber (bill)	&lt;p&gt;John Huber&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3710 West Soda Rock Lane&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;huberjr@wellsfargo.com&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(650) 924-6998&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;___________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;Contractor moved our antenna and we lost connection to radio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;Sent Rich out to re-align it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;Peaked radio with rich and got -59 signal strength.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;Down graded firmaware to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;WA.V8.7.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;_____________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;Bill: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;(1) Hour of labor: ($110/per hour) : $110&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;_____________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;Emailed invoice #35567 on 9.16.2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;- JD 9.16.2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1650	10	2021-09-16	2	\N	2021-09-15 14:43:21.031417-07	James	2021-09-16 10:08:49.989326-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
21	5	2	TT-210716 -  Josie McGann (  Audit camera install and remote access )    	&lt;div&gt;Josie McGann&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;18 Waldruhe Heights&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Glen Ellen, Ca 95422&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;(415) 297-2202&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Audit camera /&amp;nbsp; NVR install,&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;figure out what needs to be done to get billing finished.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amount Due:&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="amountdollar" style="color: rgb(34, 119, 0);"&gt;$1,695.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here is her email:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="moz-email-headers-table" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th valign="BASELINE" nowrap="nowrap" align="RIGHT"&gt;Subject:\n            &lt;/th&gt;\n            &lt;td&gt;Re: Invoice 34523 from Rhinobee Internet Services&lt;/td&gt;\n          &lt;/tr&gt;\n          &lt;tr&gt;\n            &lt;th valign="BASELINE" nowrap="nowrap" align="RIGHT"&gt;Date: &lt;/th&gt;\n            &lt;td&gt;Wed, 7 Jul 2021 06:22:34 -0700&lt;/td&gt;\n          &lt;/tr&gt;\n          &lt;tr&gt;\n            &lt;th valign="BASELINE" nowrap="nowrap" align="RIGHT"&gt;From: &lt;/th&gt;\n            &lt;td&gt;Josie McGann &lt;a class="moz-txt-link-rfc2396E" href="mailto:josiemcgann@gmail.com"&gt;&amp;lt;josiemcgann@gmail.com&amp;gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n          &lt;/tr&gt;\n          &lt;tr&gt;\n            &lt;th valign="BASELINE" nowrap="nowrap" align="RIGHT"&gt;To: &lt;/th&gt;\n            &lt;td&gt;&lt;a class="moz-txt-link-abbreviated" href="mailto:billing@rhinobee.com"&gt;billing@rhinobee.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n          &lt;/tr&gt;\n        &lt;/tbody&gt;\n      &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;\n      &lt;br&gt;\n      &lt;br&gt;\n      \n      Good Morning,\n      &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;We have been away and I have just viewed your\n        invoice. I would love to pay the bill but we do not yet have the\n        service completed. I believe the hold-up is finding an app to\n        support the system. Please have someone follow up with me to let\n        me know if there’s been any progress.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Thanks,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;\n      \n      &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Josie&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Kevin ( 7-16-2021 )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;_____________________________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;b&gt;*Scheduled Service Call: Install new device for remote access to cameras - 9.2.2021 @ 9-10AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Assist Josie once we have swapped out the UniFi NVR for the UniFi ClouldKey Gen2 and test to ensure the cameras are viewable&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Andre will assist and also then after train Josie in how to operate the application (UniFi Protect) To view her devices remotely.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* We Have Created 2 Profiles: 1 for Josie to access the NVR Remotely and the second being a Super Admin account for Rhinobee:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Josie Login: casamcgann / lungs4matt&lt;br&gt;Rhinobee Login: admin / bigbizINF!007&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;UniFi ClouldKey Gen2 (10.1.32.10)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;-AL 9.2.2021&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;_____________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Setting up NVR (10.1.32.10) but it hangs on loading the log in.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Found it had an IP conflict with the Edge Switch.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Disconnected the NVR and changed the Switch IP to 10.1.32.21, reconnected the NVR (74:83:c2:7b:6c:31)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* On the NVR loading screen Andre hit the grid of buttons at the top right of the page to access settings. He enabled the protect application and updated it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Logged into the device and adapted the cameras it detected.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Updated the cameras and set the motion field. Walked the McGann's through installing and using the app.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;* Andre will be reaching out and going over further training shortly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;-JM 09/02/21&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;_____________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Add cameras to nagios&amp;nbsp; (x)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;_______________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Go over billing with Andre and send ticket to Kayla.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;______________________________-&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;Paid by check on installation day of new NVR&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;-AL 1.7.2021&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;	1105	6	2021-09-06	5	\N	2021-07-16 04:45:10.272105-07	\N	2022-01-07 14:50:11.6984-08	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	James - 09-02-2021 21:59:07	\N	\N	\N	\N
