22	1	2	TT-210716 - Craig Hartman (Performance issues zoom, LAN?)	&lt;p&gt;* Craig H.'s zoom calls are unstable. He is getting ~6mbps down and ~2mbps up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JM 07/16/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;CPE= 10.77.10.179&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Called Craig, he reports his last speed tests was getting close to 10mbps download, that is what he is capped at.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Upgraded his CPE firmware&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He is also going to be calling sales to see if he is paying for premium service or just regular service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-JM 07/22/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Andre and Julian looked into this and discovered that Craig was supposed to be on a Hi-Speed Trial for about a week to see if the hi-speed package was suitable for his needs, the speeds are set to 17.5 down and 6.5 Up&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Julian will reach out to follow up and advise Craig of his options. Keep on hi-speed or go back to Base Package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 12.20.21&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I have contacted Craig and he has confirmed to me that he would like to be kept on the Hi-Speed plan. I have gone and adjusted his monthly billing accordingly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;- JD 12/20/21&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1564	10	2021-12-20	1	\N	2021-07-16 15:04:41.188071-07	\N	2021-12-20 15:00:53.344769-08	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	James - 09-16-2021 23:50:04	\N	\N	\N
244	2	2	TT-211230 - North Gate Ready Mix (2nd-location) - (550 Caletti Ave, Windsor)	&lt;p&gt;North Gate Ready Mix (2nd-location)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;550 Caletti Ave&lt;br&gt;Windsor, 95492&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;dawn@northgatereadymix.com&lt;br&gt;(707) 321-8437&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled Service Call: 12.30.2021 @ 12:30pm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Recieved a call from Best Truck Body (New Owners of Steve Allred's property) that they got word that they will be taking down our equipment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Reached out to Dawn to inform her of the situation, she has approved to get the relay up and keep their 2nd office alive&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre&gt;PowerBeam M5: cpe-northgate2&lt;br&gt;IP:10.77.4.84&lt;br&gt;NM: 255.255.255.224&lt;br&gt;GW: 10.77.4.65&lt;br&gt;--&lt;br&gt;SSID: rhinobee.x1&lt;br&gt;PASS: rhin0beewirele55&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;* NanoStation M5: PTP-AP-northgate2 - 192.168.20.10&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* NanoBeam M5 19: PTP-ST-northgate2 - 192.168.20.11 - Was 10.77.4.117&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need a Management Net IP so we can see all the devices we are setting up&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Next step - Access Point(s) for the yard area&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 12.30.2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everything got canceled due to comcast installing their service in the area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Closing ticket due to completion of job&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 9.19.2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1880	8	2021-12-30	2	\N	2021-12-30 12:01:25.010046-08	Andre	2022-09-19 16:43:52.293659-07	Andre	Andre - 12-30-2021 20:01:25	Andre - 12-30-2021 20:01:25	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
194	8	2	SR - 21115 (Robert Frommer - 3466 Warm Springs Road)	&lt;p&gt;Robert Frommer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3466 Warm Springs Road&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Glen Ellen, CA 95442&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;rfrommer44@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(415) 568-6824&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;_________________________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;Robert called in saying that after a installation done at his property cables are a mess. He is wondering if it possible to have someone come out and clean it up. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;- JD 11.5.2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1889	6	2021-11-05	1	\N	2021-11-05 11:59:41.453774-07	Julian	2022-01-03 14:45:23.776183-08	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
