72	2	2	TT-210804 - Tony Jurasek (billing)	&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;Jurasek, Tony&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;3458 Warm Springs Rd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;tsjurasek@sbcglobal.net&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;(707) 938-1636&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;__________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;Laptops can get online fine but eithernet connected PC is offline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;PC doesnt detect any any network plugged in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;I can see his radio online and can ping his air router from the radio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;Can proxy into the radio and ssh into the airrouter but cant http into the air router&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;Updating the air routers firmware.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;If firmware update doesnt resolve the problem we will need to replace the air router. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;-JM 08/04/21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;_______________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;Update did not resolve issue, setting up dispatch for between 1 and 2 pm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;-JM 08/04/21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;_______________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;Need to go over billing audit with Andre.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space: pre;"&gt;-JM 09/06/21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;_______________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-space: pre;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Billing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; white-