19	1	2	SR-210704 -  Scott McLeod ( 10001 Slattery Rd )	&lt;p&gt;Scott &amp;amp; Kathleen McLeod&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;10001 Slattery Rd&lt;br&gt;Glen Ellen, CA 95442&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;gate code is #9544&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scott McLeod -&amp;nbsp;(707) 486-5747&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kathleen McLeod -&amp;nbsp;kathleenmcleod707@gmail.com -&amp;nbsp;(707) 486-1905&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;Has Contractor:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An exiting customer.&amp;nbsp; Built a&amp;nbsp; 2nd structure on property.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Wants to get internet there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp; are customers in Glen Ellen.&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;I’m building a garage/office and wonder if I need a new connection or just connect the house with the new garage?&lt;br&gt;What type of cable is it?&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;It’s not Cat5 or 6, Want to install the cable before&amp;nbsp; we close up the walls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;gt; Thanks for letting me know.&amp;nbsp; The distance is about 200 feet&amp;nbsp; and I would have to trench over to it.&amp;nbsp; Rather put&amp;nbsp; in a new dish and hub.&amp;nbsp; Can you let me know what that would cost?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Site survey his property:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;1.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt; do we use direct burial and conduit ?&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;2.)&amp;nbsp; &lt;/b&gt;Or do we install a 2nd cpe ?&lt;br&gt;** Note he has conduit that is shy of 40 feet from structure. I have spoken with him and needs tech to determine what the best path is for service.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Schedule a site survey: (&amp;nbsp; keep tract of time will be subtracted from install fee time of 3ish hours )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kevin ( 7-16-2021 )&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________