20	1	2	TT-210716 -  Dawn Soiland ( Northgate Ready Mix ) 	&lt;p&gt;James,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Follow up the support email from Dawn from 7/14/2021 at 3:20pm.&amp;nbsp; Update her via phone please.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kevin ( 7-16-2021 )&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Good afternoon,&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;For some reason we had another internet disruption yesterday afternoon.\n&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;It’s so difficult to get our work done when this \nhappens every afternoon.&amp;nbsp; Apparently yesterday it just was unusable \nagain.&amp;nbsp; Sometimes it’s just extremely delayed.&amp;nbsp;\n&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;We are processing credit card payments which due to delays, either don’t get finalized, or get duplicated.&amp;nbsp;\n&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Is there any way we could have the relay on our own warehouse building instead of the neighbor’s on Caletti Avenue?&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Dawn Soiland&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Soiland Resources, LLC &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Northgate Ready Mix&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Wildease, LLC &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Cell # 707-321-8437&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;__________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;* Called Dawn and informed her about what happened on Friday, the mower incident, and the satellite office power outage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;* She still strongly wants to move the relay onto their own warehouse.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;* Need to find somewhere on her warehouse / facility we can set up the relay. Then message her back with a possible plan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Emailed her with a possible relay move, added map to her customer folder.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Pending email back from her with next step in moving relay.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;-JM 07/20/2021&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;__________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class="moz-quote-pre" wrap=""&gt;I understand that... I was suggesting a relay on top of the building, so that it is the tall point going across the freeway to the mountains. \nIsn't it possible to have the point on the top of the warehouse provide the internet to our little mobilehome office?  From what I understand you have our current service pointing to someone else's warehouse.  I'm suggesting we point to our own warehouse, which then shoots across the freeway, with all those other lines. \n\nDawn Soiland\nCell# 707-321-8437&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please Refer to ticker # 244 for updates on this project&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AL 1.7.2021&lt;/p&gt;	1880	6	2021-07-22	1	\N	2021-07-16 04:07:32.347452-07	\N	2022-01-07 14:43:33.708376-08	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
