28	8	2	TT-210719 - Lynne Mcgraw - (10600 Slattery Road, Glen Ellen)	&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Lynn Mcgaw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;10600 Slattery Road&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;"&gt;Glen Ellen, CA 95442&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;ldeegan@pacbell.net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(415) 999-0109&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Scheduled service tech: Monday afternoon 7/19/21 after first appointment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* I can log into her router and see she has a second ASUS router connected to our equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* Andre will take a look at her LAN and we will set up monitoring on her network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;-JM 07/19/2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* GFI in the garage was triggered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* Andres reset the GFI in garage on east wall, re-powered the switch, and restored service. This GFI circuit will cut off all power to basement where the internet is plugged in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Andres was there for 1/2 hrs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* She gave us a case of wine, Niice!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;-JM 07/19/2021&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700; font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;"&gt;Scheduled service tech: Wednesday Morning 08/04/21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700; font-family: Arial;"&gt;Schedule an appointment to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1) install new switch - Edge Router&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2) Remove ASUS router - Install additional Puck in basement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;3) Put her UniFi access points into our controller&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4) Add all devices into Nagios with management net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Summary of Scheduled Service: 8.4.2021&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* Rich arrived at 9:30am, and had looked around the property to understand Lynn's Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;* We had identified the following:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • UniFi AP-LR in the Utility Room&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; • UniFi AP-Outdoor+ located by the pool area&lt;br&g