450	2	2	TT-220901 - Raymond Guzman - (7029 Faught Rd, Santa Rosa) Questioning 5/26/22 invoice - Updated 9.22.2022	&lt;p&gt;Raymond Guzman&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7029 Faught Rd&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Santa Rosa, CA&amp;nbsp; 95403&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He is questioning invoice dated 5/26/22 for $1262.50: 3.5 hours labor, APU router, Edge Switch 10XP, Touch Switch 5 Port PoE.&amp;nbsp; He said you told him it would be much less $$, around $700 or so.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- LRK 9/1/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing for&amp;nbsp;Scheduled Service call / Installation of devices: 5.20.2022 @ 12-1pm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* (3.5) Hours of Labor (@ $125/hr) =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;$437.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* (1) APU Router (@ $425/ea) =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;$425&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Custom build Router to help manage Ray's Network&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* (1) EdgeSwitch 10XP 8 Port PoE Managed Switch =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;$350&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Located in the Office to power the Head in Radio and extend his network to the Garage Switch&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* (1) TouchSwitch 5 Port PoE Managed Switch =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;$50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - Located in the Garage to help power the Station Radio to beam down to the Gate, Connect his NVR and power the Garage Access Point. - Device is a Used switch so if it dies within a year from the installation job we will replace it.&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;** TOTAL =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;$1262.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;-AL 5.24.2022&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;u&gt;Schedueld 06/01/2022 12-1pm&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;We are replacing the toughswitch in garage with a Edgeswitch10xp&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;-----------------------&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;Need to reach out to ray and let him understand that the final quote is for what we did, don't know where the 700 estimate came from.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;-AL 9.22.2022&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;---------------------------------------------&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;9/28/22&amp;nbsp; Greetings Ray;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Andre sent me this message before he left for vacation for 3 weeks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Need to reach out to ray and let him understand that the final quote is for what we did, don't know where the 700 estimate came from.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It sounds like miscommunication.&amp;nbsp; The cost of the equipment is $825. Thank you. Linda&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-LRK 9/28/22&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;_____________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;CHARGE RAY $1,100 FOR TOTAL COST OF PROJECT&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;NON-NEGOTIABLE&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;d