272	2	2	TT-220217 - Judy Walker - (5890 Pruitt Ave, Windsor)	&lt;p&gt;Judy Walker&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;5890 Pruitt Avenue&lt;br&gt;Windsor, CA&amp;nbsp;95492&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;judy@jgwevents.com&lt;br&gt;(707) 953-3909&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Scheduled Service Call 2.17.2022 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;after morning job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Judy called and left a message at the end of the day stating she's having internet issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We notice the data link from the AirRouter to the NanoStation M5 go from 'unplugged&amp;gt; 10mbps &amp;gt; plugged &amp;gt; 100mbps &amp;gt; unplugged ...'&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We are able to remove the NSM5 as it was used before as a Access Point and connect the Powerbeam 5AC directly to the airRouter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 2.17.2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.) Removed from nagios:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AP.rly-Judy.Walker&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;10.77.4.70,&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2,)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Found that&amp;nbsp; also found that&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;cpe-Northgate.Ready.Mix.2&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;was connected to this ap in Nagios erroneously.&amp;nbsp; Moved it to the correct ap,&amp;nbsp;X1-shiloh-ap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;kevin 2.20.2022&lt;/p&gt;	1227	8	2022-02-20	2	\N	2022-02-17 02:18:13.978088-08	Andre	2022-02-20 10:00:50.858123-08	Kevin	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
273	2	2	Lisa Bryant (298 Colonial Park Dr, Santa Rosa)	&lt;p&gt;Monday (02/21/2022)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lisa called up referring to inconsistent speeds.&lt;br&gt;She previously called in about bumping up to the higher package. She noticed no real change.&lt;br&gt;She has a video loading and hang up issue on both her laptop and her roku&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*looked at both her cpe and ap for oddities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*The Cpe (10.77.7.22) has a fairly inconsistent signal strength&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*The Ap (192.168.20.10)&amp;nbsp; has a few devices that are having a poor connection.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;More research is needed&lt;br&gt;considering resting the ap to be on the unifi controller.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Changed the channel on ap (10.77.7.2) to 5750 and the width to 40.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is 25 customers on the ap (10.77.7.2)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Put change notes for (10.77.7.2) in freeside&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Aaron&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We want to replace her AP and add it to the unifi controller.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As well as see if we can optimize her CPE, there is a lot of interference from the surrounding area.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She is available 03/10/2022 9am -10am&lt;br&gt;So scheduled for that date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sending out:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; *NanoStation AC Loco&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; *2 Pucks just in case. one to extend the reach of the existing and one to replace the old one if it turns out its no good after nuking it to 0 doesn't fix the range issue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Aaron&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thursday: 03/10/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Changing the cpe did nothing, we changed it back to the old one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;after looking more into it Andre changed the channel width from 40 to 20 on the AP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When Keven and I changed the frequency and channel width it worked till the evening.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Changing the width back down helped a lot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-Aaron&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1931	8	2022-03-10	2	\N	2022-02-21 16:09:59.753988-08	Aaron	2022-03-10 15:25:43.118597-08	Aaron	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
