eena that we could install an access point, if you wanted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 10/12/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;LInda&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;2.25 hours labor total time spent&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;1.25 hours labor Replacing CPE&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;( Warrenty work - No charge ) &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 hour labor&amp;nbsp; testing and trouble shooting wifi-LAN&amp;nbsp; (&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;No charge -&amp;nbsp; comped )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please send her a statement showing the $125.00 billing for the one hour LAN trouble shooting labor /&amp;nbsp; comped&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She got me to verbally agree that this service call.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Hook line and sinker.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;should have told her that,&amp;nbsp; giving the discount was conditional on it "actually being our issue"&amp;nbsp; Meh!!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kevin 10/12/2022&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Done.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-LRK 10/27/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1996	12	2022-10-12	2	\N	2022-10-11 04:49:03.646277-07	Kevin	2022-10-27 10:31:10.276684-07	Linda	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
