ews while she does work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* An example she gave me was that whenever she turns on her IPad to do work her Roku would begin to buffer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Will be looking into her network further and will be doing a bit of research on Roku.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 10/19/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Spoke with Andrea again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Explained to me that the issues with her Roku are still occurring.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* When Black Friday comes she may just get a newer Roku.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* She is having some issues with connection whenever she is in her room.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* She also told me Don is considering selling the home and do to this she is looking to move out soon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* With her moving out soon she told me its okay if we just hold off till she buys a new Roku though us just ignoring issues goes against what we stand for especially as this was just her feeling bad for taking our time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I will convene with Andre and see what he thinks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 10/27/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Closing ticket due to inactivity and also cause this is a LAN issue Andrea needs to solve.&lt;/p&gt;	1846	10	2022-10-07	2	\N	2022-10-05 17:58:17.919094-07	Julian	2022-11-11 11:10:12.878309-08	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
