444	1	2	SR-220825-Jim Stice (22776 Moscow Rd)	&lt;p&gt;Jim Stice&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;22776 Moscow Road&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Duncan Mills, CA&amp;nbsp;95430&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;jstice@dlsi.org&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(707)529-8472&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jim mentioned to me that a line from Comcast was installed to his location and that he has a generator setup for his home. He mentioned his main connection was setup to be from a garage to his home. He would like to reverse the setup so he can make sure his generator covers his devices as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 8/25/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reach out to Jim Stice and find out what happened to this ticket. Does he still need or services?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 11.19.2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* His internet modem is 200 ft from his home.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* we set a PtP from music studio to home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* He has generator at his home so he'd like to move the modem there so if power ever goes out the connection doesn't go down.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* He is essentially wanting us to reverse the PtP to shoot from the home to the music studio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* He also told me in the studio they use the modem as there access point and switch so if we take the modem out we need to supply him with a access point and a switch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I told him I would speak with the guys and call him back for scheduling. Luckily he inst in a rush about this.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* As well I looked and found Andre he is not a wireless customer we only setup his LAN.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 11/22/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Closing ticket - Following up with client and will create new ticket if customer is still interested in our services&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 4.7.2023&lt;/p&gt;	1678	10	2022-09-02	1	\N	2022-08-25 14:12:00.873474-07	Julian	2023-04-07 11:23:44.397847-07	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
712	2	2	TT-230208 - Laura Allen (350 E Street)	&lt;p&gt;Laura Allen&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;350 E Street&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Santa Rosa, CA 95404&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;lauraallen369@protonmail.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;(707) 888-2210&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Laura called in saying her son is having trouble getting his computer to connect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* She also mentioned she got a new AP that she wishes for us to adopt and monitor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 2/8/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Summary/Scheduled Service Call: 2/8/23 @ 2PM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We adopted a device that Laura had already installed near the Piano.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Rich helped wire Ethernet to the sons PC.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Rich also helped Laura connect her TV to the network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.5x Hours Labor (@$125/ea) = $187.50&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Total: $187.50&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2/9/23 Ron's credit card declined the Feb. 1st bill of $150.&amp;nbsp; I don't know if anyone followed up with him concerning slower speeds to reduce the monthly bill from the ticket I created 1/5/23.&amp;nbsp; I doubt he will pay for this latest charge of&amp;nbsp; $187.50.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What do we do now if neither will pay for the account?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1/5/22 Greetings Ron, I will create a service ticket for the support department to contact you concerning slower internet speeds. Thank you. Linda&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On 1/4/2023 9:28 PM, Ron Allen wrote: Okay and I see the troubleshooting invoice attached. When you get a chance I need to get my hands wrapped around this account and I need to reduce the payments. What slower speeds do you have available while we asess the situation? And I don't want to authorize any further troubleshooting work.&amp;nbsp; Thanks Ronald Allen&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Jan. 5 Signal post: Good day.&amp;nbsp; We need to discuss the Ron &amp;amp; Laura Allen Drama show.&amp;nbsp; She told&amp;nbsp; me to bill him. She does not have the means to pay.&amp;nbsp; Bottom line:&amp;nbsp; she cannot have the account in her name and expect him to pay.&amp;nbsp; He does not want her to have anything to do with the account. Does NOT authorize any more troubleshooting work.&amp;nbsp; Now wants to look at slower speeds to reduce the monthly bill.&amp;nbsp; This is a mess in which we find ourselves in the middle.&amp;nbsp; Good grief!!&amp;nbsp; I wrote this in lieu of another trouble ticket. BIG trouble indeed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-LRK 2/9/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing sorted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 5.19.2023&lt;/p&gt;	1183	6	2023-02-09	2	\N	2023-02-08 16:39:00.828409-08	Julian	2023-05-19 18:20:16.97277-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
