744	1	2	SR-230304 - Lynn Garric - (5400 Alpine Rod, Santa Rosa)	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 01-08-2023 08:16am&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lynn Garric&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5400 Alpine Rod&lt;br&gt;Santa Rosa, 95404&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;cransac@sonic.net&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7077562639&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;p&gt;You installed 2 radio transmitters for me years ago, and I'm interested in that again. I have good internet service with Starlink, however, I have a second building/workshop that does not have internet access. I would like to put up transmitters to send the signal from my starlink dish to my other building. Can you tell me if you can do that, and at what approximate cost. Email is the best way to communicate with me. Thank you. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 3/4/2023&lt;/p&gt;	\N	6	2023-03-05	12	\N	2023-03-03 20:59:46.474603-08	\N	2023-05-19 18:49:08.669193-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 03-04-2023 05:00:30	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
