958	2	2	TT-230706 - Marie  Huber - (3710 West Soda Rock Lane, Healdsburg)	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 07-06-2023 09:14am&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marie  Huber&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3710 West Soda Rock Lane&lt;br&gt;Healdsburg, 95448&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gate Code:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;2231&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;huberjr@wellsfargo.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(650) 868-7791&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled for Service Call / Survey for WiFi Upgrade - 7.6.23 @ 9-10 AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Called in complaining of spotty service in the main house and no service in the guest house sending Rich out this morning 7/6/2023 to do a survey and see what would need to be done.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 7/6/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*** SUMARRY OF VISIT&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Need to install a Lightning Protector where the conduit and our Ethernet cable meets for our CPE.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to send quote to customer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 2-3 hours with 2 people to run CAT5 Cable (@175/hr)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 2-3 UniFi 6 AP&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; * One in the Utility Closet&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; * One in the Guest House&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; * One Extra if needed to cover the rest of the Main House&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 7.6.23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled WiFi Upgrade: Friday 7.28.2023 @ 9-10AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Andre and Rich will work together for a cable run into the Huber's Home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to pinpoint location of PoE Brick for the CPE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Ensure coverage between Main house and Guest house is solid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 7.27.2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Installed 2 Access Points&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - 1 in Guest house&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - 1 in Master bedroom in Main house&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Provided network discovery for their property&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- - - -&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(2) UniFi WiFi6-Lite Access Points (@ $ 150/ea) = &lt;b&gt;$300&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) Hour of Labor Single Tech (@ $125/hr) = &lt;b&gt;$125&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(2) Hours of Labor for 2 Techs (@ $175/hr) = &lt;b&gt;$350&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Total: $775&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;-AL 8.16.2023&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;___________________________&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Done&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;-LRK 8/16/23&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	\N	12	2023-07-07	2	\N	2023-07-06 09:15:23.517051-07	\N	2023-08-16 14:57:06.457819-07	Linda	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 07-06-2023 06:29:47	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
