611	1	2	SR-221211 - Millo fenzi - (470 sonoma mountain road, petaluma)	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 12-03-2022 07:29am&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Millo fenzi&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;470 sonoma mountain road&lt;br&gt;petaluma, 94954&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;fenzi@comcast.net&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;408-316-7806&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Marc Schwager, a buddy, who lives on Cavedale Rd and is associated with Mayacamas Fire Station who use your service. I am purchasing 470 Sonoma Mtn Rd and looking for fast internet service. The current owner uses Web Perception for internet service. We live on the Peninsula south of SF and currently use Comcast Cable Modem. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 12/11/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Customer has no line of sight to any of our relays&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to discuss with team to double check&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* &lt;b&gt;NVO&lt;/b&gt; - no line of sight to any of our relays, Property is surrounded by hills&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 12.10.2022&lt;/p&gt;	\N	6	2022-12-12	12	\N	2022-12-10 17:13:11.108763-08	\N	2023-03-08 16:28:30.371554-08	Andre	\N	\N	<li><strong>Needs more info</strong> - <span>Reaching out to client to let them aware we are looking into their request</span>Andre 12-12-2022 22:02:00</li>	\N	 - 12-11-2022 01:28:06	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
