598	2	2	TT-22125 - Heidi Jacquin - (3184 guerneville rd, Santa Rosa)	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 12-04-2022 05:47pm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Heidi Jacquin&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3184 guerneville rd&lt;br&gt;Santa Rosa, 95401&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;heidijacquin@me.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4159398700&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenants tv is constantly buffering\r\n\r\nPlease advise&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 12/5/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Called Heidi back and she said her tenant is reporting the whole connection since it was installed hasn't been working well though it mainly has been showing with the TV.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Will be looking into her network and will report to her my findings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 12/5/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Looked into her network with Andre's assistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We found multiple configurations within the devices at the caretakers home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Also noticed the devices were never added into Nagios so I went in and added them in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - LAN.ST-Heidi.Jacquin.Care.Taker.Home(10.0.137.20&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;LAN.AP-Heidi.Jacquin.Care.Taker.Home (10.0.137.21)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Attempted to call her back but she did not answer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 12/8/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Client was looked after and sorted out network issue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* The Station (10.0.137.20) Was set to Router mode with incorrect DNS entries creating the illusion that our service was slow and inoperable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Station and Access point was configured appropriately and Heidi confirmed later that the client is pleased with our service.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 3.8.2023&lt;/p&gt;	2026	10	2022-12-06	12	\N	2022-12-05 09:17:15.647978-08	\N	2023-03-08 16:37:25.837518-08	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 12-05-2022 17:23:40	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
600	1	2	SR-221202 - Susan Sangiacomo - (9643 Hwy 128, Healdsburg)	&lt;p&gt;Susan Sangiacomo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;9643 Hwy 128&lt;br&gt;Healdsburg, CA 95448&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;susan333s@outlook.com&lt;br&gt;(415) 990-6561&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contractor: Joaquin Euaree&lt;br&gt;jeuaree@praxiscustom.com&lt;br&gt;(650) 207-0100&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Awaiting a call from Joaquin when to schedule.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Prevoiusly had line of sight to Crowell relay, Home had burned down from the fires back in 2019&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Joaquin is looking after the A/V work, we are going to provide their home with our service.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Was supposed to have a scheduled appointment this week but we have scheduled a different appointment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 12.5.2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to follow up with either Susan or Joaquin&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Closing ticket and reaching out to either to set-up Installation Date&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 3.8.23&lt;/p&gt;	1689	6	2022-12-12	1	\N	2022-12-05 18:07:39.06783-08	Andre	2023-03-08 17:18:59.079514-08	Andre	Andre - 12-06-2022 02:07:39	Andre - 12-06-2022 02:07:39	<li><strong>Accepted</strong> - <span>Susan Called in regarding Scheduling</span>Andre 12-06-2022 02:07:39</li><li><strong>Left voicemail</strong> - <span></span>Andre 12-16-2022 20:32:04</li>	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
561	2	2	221115 - Marika Neto - (1730 Mark West Springs Rd., Santa Rosa)	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 11-11-2022 04:15pm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marika Neto&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1730 Mark West Springs Rd.&lt;br&gt;Santa Rosa, 95404&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;marikaneto@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;707-889-15&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;Marika called in and mentioned she has having issues with her connection. She mentioned there is times where her netlfix, disneyplus, etc just buffers and that her phones have poor connections. She claims at most they are only using a couple devices typically. She is also mentioned we in the past told her we would look into installing more devices in the home. As well she told me that her phones don't pick up calls and that she has been in contact with there provider and even replaced there phones and yet the issues are still happening so she believes its her WiFi. While on the phone I look into MRTG and saw at times her bandwidth would just max out. This was the case while on the phone so I asked what she was doing and she said the only device she had running was her Sony TV streaming Disney Plus. (RBID = 1640) - JD 11/11/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 11/15/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Investigated network with Andre's assistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We did tcpdump on there CPE looking at the eth0 interface to locate the device that's hogging there bandwith.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Here is the device we found that is using the most bandwidth. Did a mac lookup and saw the vendor is&amp;nbsp;Wistron Neweb Corporation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Mac: 1C:D6:BE:60:5A:F5&lt;span style="white-space:pre"&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;IP: 192.168.20.100&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Wistron does WiFi cards for many high end companies with on being Sony. This leads me to believe its possibly her Sony TV which she uses to watch Disney+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Also did some research on Disney+ and found that there 4k streams takes up 30mbs and there enhanced stream can take up to 80mbs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Will call back and let her know about Disney+ and the bandwidth it can possibly soak up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 11/16/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Talked to Marika and told her about Disney+ she told she does notice its Disney+ that buffers the most when she watches it compared to other streaming services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* She told me though that her phones are still unable to connect to the network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Investigated her network and saw there may be possible interference with the NSM2 so I changed it from channel 11 to channel 1.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* She also told me that she is willing for us to come out and investigate her network and at the same time upgrade her setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 11/16/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to follow-up with customer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Closing ticket due to inactivity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 3.8.23&lt;/p&gt;	1640	10	2022-11-16	12	\N	2022-11-15 10:12:35.489591-08	\N	2023-03-08 17:21:49.218965-08	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 11-15-2022 18:54:27	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
