777	2	2	TT-230312 - Billy Azevedo (3651 Mark West Station Rd)	&lt;p&gt;Billy Azevedo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3651 Mark West Station Rdvi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Windsor, CA 95492&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;azevedob@aol.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(707) 481-1189&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Billy called into support saying his connection has been cutting out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I checked his CPE and saw the CCQ was at around 60%&amp;nbsp; with a average signal of -69.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* According to MRTG the signal lowered since last thursday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Was worried about trees being in the way but Billy checked the line of sight and saw the nearest tree was to the left.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Billy mentioned that there windmill was at one point reading 75 mile an hour winds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I am thinking theirs a chance the winds could have shifted the CPE.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Will be sending Rich to check it out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/13/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled Service Call: Wednesday 3/15/23 @ 9AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;_______________________&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Me and Rich ended up looking at his CPE and we did a scan and saw he has amazing connection to TV West.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We did a test to see how his CPE would run and it was near perfect reaching CCQ of 98% and a signal of -65 dBm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We applied the switch to TV West and called Billy and he said it was running great.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* As we had him do a speed test he asked if we have a higher speed package, so I told him I would reach out to Andre and have him call him whenever hes available to do&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre&gt;Billys new config:&lt;br&gt;IP: 10.77.2.152&lt;br&gt;GW: 10.77.2.253&lt;br&gt;SN: 255.255.255.0&lt;br&gt;---------&lt;br&gt;SSID: Rhinobee-HIVE3&lt;br&gt;Key: &lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;** I need to make sure to move his CPE in Nagios before closing this ticket. &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/14/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Adjusted Billy's CPE Nagios entry though I need to fix his route for his mgmt net.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/14/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Went in and fixed Billy's route. Mgmt net is now pinging.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/15/23&lt;/p&gt;	1306	10	2023-03-16	2	\N	2023-03-13 14:41:54.642096-07	Julian	2023-03-15 10:08:58.455098-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
