787	2	2	TT-230322 - Johan  Lozano - (3915 Mark West Sta Rd, Windsor )	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 03-22-2023 02:12pm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Johan  Lozano&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3915 Mark West Sta Rd&lt;br&gt;Windsor , 95492&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;whs.johan@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;707-694-9657&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dear Rhinobee \r\n\r\nI hope this question finds you well. I am writing to inform you about an issue we have been experiencing with our Wi-Fi connection over the past week. It has come to my attention that the Wi-Fi speeds have been significantly slower than normal, causing disruptions in our daily tasks and overall productivity.\r\n\r\nI have tried troubleshooting the issue by restarting the router and checking for any possible network interference, but the problem persists. As a result, I kindly request your assistance in looking into this matter and providing a solution to restore our Wi-Fi speeds to their usual performance.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you require any additional information or if there is a convenient time for us to discuss this issue further. I appreciate your prompt attention to this matter and look forward to a resolution soon.\r\n\r\nThank you for your support.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nJohan Lozano&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 3/22/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Went in and saw his CCQ was dropping down to 60%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Was told by Rich that he looked into it before I came in and that Johan would benefit from a AP change.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Took a look and saw he had great signal to Hive-3.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;* Changed his connection to Hive-3 and his signal increased and CCQ went to 99%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Added his new information as a new entry in Nagios to match his new placement under X1.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Attempted to follow up with him though he did not answer, will call again tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre&gt;Johan's new CPE Config&lt;br&gt;IP: 10.77.2.153&lt;br&gt;SN: 255.255.255.0&lt;br&gt;GW: 10.77.2.253&lt;br&gt;--------&lt;br&gt;SSID: Rhinobee-HIVE3&lt;br&gt;Key:&amp;nbsp;rhin0bee.#&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/23/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Called Johan back and he said everything has been working fine since we made the changes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/29/23&lt;/p&gt;	1380	10	2023-03-23	12	\N	2023-03-22 14:40:11.359672-07	\N	2023-03-29 11:25:23.285033-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 03-24-2023 00:56:04	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
639	1	2	SR-222812 - Chris and Kelly Matthies - (5900 Pruitt Ave., Unit 230, Windsor)	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 12-23-2022 10:00am&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chris and Kelly Matthies&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5900 Pruitt Ave., Unit 230&lt;br&gt;Windsor, 95492&lt;/p&gt;Office Number: (707) 687-5149&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;chris@sonomabrothersdistilling.com / (707) 888-2120&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;kelly@sonomabrothersdistilling.com / (707) 478-5659&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;The previous tenant to this address used you as their internet provider.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 12/28/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Client had reached out to us on the Tuesday regarding the Service&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Rich did notice they have a radio still, just needs to be powered up&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Left a voicemail for client&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 1.12.2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled Service Call to Re-Establish Internet Service: 03.23.23 @ 9-10AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Sending rich out to re-establish service for new clients taking over the True Liberty Bags Property&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* You will be meeting up with their person names Austin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* If the radio is functional we just then need to install an Access Point to provide WiFi for their Business&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Use default credentials for the time being: SSID / PASS =&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Sonoma Bros Distilling Net /&amp;nbsp;7076875149&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Install either a NanoHD or Flex HD&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre&gt;Insert Credentials here:&lt;br&gt;IP:&amp;nbsp;10.77.10.82\r\nNM:&amp;nbsp;255.255.255.224&lt;br&gt;GW:&amp;nbsp;10.77.10.65&lt;br&gt;SSID:&amp;nbsp;i^&amp;amp;.x1&lt;br&gt;PASS:&amp;nbsp;rhin0beewirele55&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 3.22.2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Summary:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Installed PowerBeam M5.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Had to change CPE to connect to Shiloh X1 due to stronger signal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Installed a FlexHD&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/23/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Added Freeside Entry&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Added Nagios entry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/23/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2x Hours Labor (@$125/ea) = $250&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Reestablishing connection and installing access point to provide WiFi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1x FlexHD (@210/ea) = $210&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monthly = $80&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Total = $460&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Julian, what is the monthly service charge?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-LRK 3/27/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;____________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I added the monthly apologize.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 3/29/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Done&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-LRK 3/29/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	2107	12	2023-03-23	12	\N	2022-12-28 15:10:52.541308-08	\N	2023-03-29 14:27:23.965561-07	Linda	\N	\N	<li><strong>Left voicemail</strong> - <span>Regarding Investigation into usable CPE left by True Liberty Bags</span>Kevin 01-12-2023 07:34:13</li><li><strong>Accepted</strong> - <span>Called Kelly to Schedule for Thursday Morning. She Accepted.</span>Julian 03-23-2023 01:14:18</li>	Julian - 03-23-2023 20:46:15	 - 12-28-2022 23:11:11	\N	\N	\N	Julian - 03-23-2023 20:46:15	Julian - 03-23-2023 20:46:15	\N	\N	\N	\N
974	1	2	NVO-230722 - Nicole Bromstad - (9466 Eastside road, Healdsburg )	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 07-18-2023 09:05pm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nicole Bromstad&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;9466 Eastside road&lt;br&gt;Healdsburg , 95448&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;nicole@thejewelrybook.com&lt;br&gt;(707) 481-0146&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;Firend&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 7/22/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Virtual Site Survey lists Crowell, Shiloh X1, TV Tower or RWH2 as possible relays to connect to.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to call and Create proposal that goes over our service and cost&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* reach out to Client on Monday to Schedule Installation Appointment for our Service.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 7.22.2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled Service Installation: Tuesday 8.1.23 @ 12-1PM.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* CPE is configured to connect to AP-TV-WEST (10.77.2.206)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Customer may need Wireless Devices, Setting her up with UniFi Pucks&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 7.31.2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Status: NVO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Property has a line of dense trees, no visibility anywhere from house.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Closing Ticket.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 8.16.2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	\N	8	2023-07-23	12	\N	2023-07-22 13:46:45.505563-07	\N	2023-08-16 14:36:48.578972-07	Andre	\N	\N	<li><strong>Left voicemail</strong> - <span>Need to reach out on Monday</span> 07-22-2023 11:36:36</li>	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
