667	2	2	TT-230110 - John Teran (6450 Plum Ranch Rd)	&lt;p&gt;John Teran&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;6450 Plum Ranch Rd&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Santa Rosa, CA 95404&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;teransfam@aol.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(707) 478-5963&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* John called in yesterday saying "Why is the internet so glitchy?"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I went in and upgraded his NanoHD and rebooted all other devices on his network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Awaiting a call back to see how network is doing as I left a message.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 1/10/23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;__________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;1. Checked Nagios and saw according to Nagios everything is up besides the barn being down.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;2. He is connected to the network but it is very sluggish but near the barn he cannot connect(Well because the barn is down).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;3. He mentioned he went to all of his computers and rebooted them and cleared all caches.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;4. He mentioned he has a new neighbor who owns a software company and he told me that he believes they may have devices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;5. I mentioned to him how I see the barn is down, he told me he had people working on it so he will check on the power.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;6. Happends mainly between 4-6:30PM.&lt;br&gt;- JD 1/11/23&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;__________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* John has been calling in the past couple days&amp;nbsp; and today saying his connection has gotten worse.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* We also noticed that the backhaul from RBHQ and BzP(10.77.9.2) was having major issues.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* We fixed it and notified John that this could have been part of his issues but we still need to look into his network and see.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;- JD 3/1/23&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* Looking at the graphs and I see throughout the weekend John was having a decent amount of packet loss.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* After we did the fix you see the packet loss went down.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;- JD 3/1/23&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;_________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* He called again and said the network is performing even worse.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* I ran through and looked at all of his devices and saw nothing that would point to there being issues.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* I will reach back to him soon to have him list all details of his issues again as i did previously in the ticket to see what other details he may give.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* At this point I have no idea what his issue is.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;- JD 3/1/23&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;_________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* John called back in to Support saying he is still having issues.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* Notices major buffering and pauses during streams all day long.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* After 7PM the connection will disconnect and will come back next morning.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* Says his printer inst connecting to the network.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* He is suspicious of interference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* I asked about his computer and he said he got it looked at and they said it was fine.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;- JD 3/29/23&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;_________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled Service Call: Friday 3/31/23 11AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* We will be going in and upgrading all of his AP's to Unifi Devices.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;* Took me about 2 Hours to prepare everything&lt;/div&gt;&lt;pre style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;Devices I prepared&lt;br&gt;EdgeRouter - 10.0.80.1 - B4:FB:E4:23:0F:7F&lt;br&gt;USW-Lite-8-Poe - 10.0.80.10 - D0:21:F9:68:CD:40&lt;br&gt;UniFi AP AC LR for Garage- 10.0.80.11 - 74:AC:B9:2C:B0:3B:&lt;br&gt;UAP FlexHD For Trellis - 10.0.80.12 - F4:92:BF:96:5C:03&lt;br&gt;U6-Lite for Sons Room- 10.0.80.13 - D0:21:F9:EA:85:A4&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;- JD 3/30/23&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;_________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Billing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Equipment:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;(1) EdgeRouter (@ $175/ea) = &lt;b&gt;$175&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;(1) USW-Lite-8-PoE (@ $175/ea) = &lt;b&gt;$175&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"&gt;(1) Unifi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="3"&gt;NanoHD (@ $210/ea) = &lt;b&gt;$210&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=""&gt;&lt;font face="Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, 