817	2	2	Sandra Lewis 800 Shiloh Canyon, Santa Rosa, CA  95403 (408) 691-1328	&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Hello:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Please cancel the Rhinobee account for Sandie Lewis, 800 Shiloh Cyn, Santa Rosa, CA effective immediately.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;We have converted over to the high speed fiber internet which is now installed in Shiloh Estates.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Thank you for your support over the years.&amp;nbsp; We have been very satisfied with Rhinobee.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Regards,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700;"&gt;Sandie Lewis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700;"&gt;Canceled billing, auto pay.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700;"&gt;-LRK 4/10/23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;-------------------------------------&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;* Removed entry from Nagios.&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;* Need reach out to discuss collecting our equipment and setting up passing LAN devices to them.&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;- JD 4/11/23&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" style="width: 279.4pt;" width="373" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"&gt;\r\n&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;tr style="height:4.85pt"&gt;\r\n&lt;td style="width:149.0pt;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.85pt" width="199" valign="top"&gt;\r\n&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:130.4pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:4.85pt" width="174" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;	1684	6	2023-04-12	9	\N	2023-04-10 11:00:39.52763-07	Linda	2023-05-19 14:26:13.02743-07	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
836	2	2	TT-230418 - Keith Ross - (15100 HWY 128, Calistoga )	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 04-17-2023 10:51am&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Keith Ross&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;15100 HWY 128&lt;br&gt;Calistoga , 94515&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;rossmkeith@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;415 533-5051&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;The service has been operating very poorly for three days with multiple calls to your company. Please have a technician visit the property ASAP. I work from home and this is becoming a very significant problem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 4/18/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Duplicate ticket.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 4/18/23&lt;/p&gt;	\N	10	2023-04-19	12	\N	2023-04-18 09:12:27.266936-07	\N	2023-04-18 09:14:31.806034-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 04-18-2023 16:14:31	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
549	2	2	TT-221107 - Felipe Ramirez - (49 Colonial Park Dr., Santa Rosa)	&lt;p&gt;Felipe Ramirez&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;49 Colonial Park Dr.&lt;br&gt;Santa Rosa, 95403&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;manager@colonialpark.net&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;707-540-2851&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;Got a call from him at 10:45         |    His radio and AP- were both up and I could ping them and log into them.     |  Upgraded his cpe at 11pm        |   Please call him first thing monday morning    Julian/Andre\r\n(Kevin 11/6/2022 )&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 11/7/2022&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Talked to Felipe and he explained to when he looks at his computer he has no connection and when he clicks on network settings he gets no options at all.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I looked and saw there was traffic going through his network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* He did not check any other devices so I there is a chance it could be just his computer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Unfortunately he was not home so he could not describe to me exactly what he was seeing in detail and I wouldn't be able to guide him through troubleshooting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I told him I would call him when he is home. He will either be home 12PM-1PM on his lunch break or possibly after 3:30PM once hes done with work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 11/7/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scheduled Truck Roll: 11/7/22 @ 2-3PM&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Head out and investigate issues with his devices not connecting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Replace Open WRT puck with Ubiquiti puck.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;______________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Went out there and investigated his reports that his computer would not show any networks and that his phone would connect and say "No internet connection".&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I checked the network on my personal phone and the Rhinobee support phone and I was able to connect just fine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Had him show me his connection on his phone and it was running perfectly fine.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* looked at his computer and the network setting tab seemed a bit glitchy and&amp;nbsp; wouldn't show ANY connections even though hes so close to other customers networks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* This lead me to believe his problem lies with his computer having issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* I switched his Open WRT AC-LR with a newly flashed Ubiquiti AC-LR.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* While I was there he mentioned to me he is interested is possibly getting a switch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Will give it a couple days and call him back to check and see about selling him a switch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 11/8/22&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;___________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Julian's Labor: 1x hr (Hourly rate needs to be determined by Kevin)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1902	3	2022-11-08	2	\N	2022-11-07 09:26:09.042098-08	\N	2023-04-10 18:44:33.517191-07	Andre	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 11-07-2022 18:27:24	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
