837	2	2	TT-230418 - Keith Ross - (15100 HWY 128, Calistoga )	&lt;p&gt;Requested: 04-17-2023 10:51am&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Keith Ross&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;15100 HWY 128&lt;br&gt;Calistoga , 94515&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;rossmkeith@gmail.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;415 533-5051&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;The service has been operating very poorly for three days with multiple calls to your company. Please have a technician visit the property ASAP. I work from home and this is becoming a very significant problem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-WC 4/18/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_____________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Me and Andre looked into possible interference.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Looks at the scan on the mimosa on Crowell and saw there is heavy interference.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Changed the channel and saw major improvement on Keiths cpe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* After I checked his Access Points and noticed most of them were on the new frequency we set the cpe to, so changed the access points channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Called Keith back and he said everything is running better.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- JD 4/18/23&lt;/p&gt;	\N	10	2023-04-19	12	\N	2023-04-18 09:12:32.25874-07	\N	2023-04-18 09:25:39.020219-07	Julian	\N	\N	\N	\N	 - 04-18-2023 16:25:38	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
