931	2	2	TT-230614 - Rusty Sims - (7 Waldrue Heights, Glen Ellen)	&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rusty Sims&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;7 Waldrue Heights&lt;br&gt;Glen Ellen, CA 95442&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;rustysims@mac.com&lt;br&gt;(707) 292-0615&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scheduled Service Call - Access Point Replacement - Thursday, 6.15.2023 @&amp;nbsp; 9-10AM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Rusty chimed in this afternoon wondering why his service is not responding&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Had logged into his network and discovered his AirRouter was set to Default mode on the Date Rate Module&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Made changes and upgraded the firmware on his router&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Rusty then chimed in afterhours as his service is still having issues&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* No issue at the relay or at his CPE, whenever he performs bandwidth tests he'd get standard 10-12 down but no upload&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* We concluded that his Access Point must be faulty&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Need to create either a replacement AirRouter or utilize a UniFi 6 AP&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-AL 6.14.2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Need to bill customer for job for replacing suspect router in their home:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) Air Router HP (@ $150/ea) =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;$150&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(1) Hour of Labor for Truck Roll (@ $125/hr) =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;$125&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;total = $275&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;-AL 8.16.2023&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;_____________________________&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Done. Corrected totals above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;-LRK 8/17/23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1405	12	2023-06-15	2	\N	2023-06-14 20:23:07.610678-07	Andre	2023-08-18 18:25:10.696271-07	Andre	\N	\N	<li><strong>Accepted</strong> - <span>Scheduled for 9-10AM</span>Andre 06-15-2023 03:23:07</li>	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
