848	4	1	TT-230422 - switch4 at Hurricane Electric is malfunctioning	&lt;p&gt;* HP switch at HE, switch4.bigbiz.com (216.218.199.4),  is misbehaving (snmp response stalls / failures, and irregular high ping times).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Fortunately, the problem doesn't seem to be affecting the boxes that go thru switch4 -- rigel, vega, and their VMs&lt;br&gt;all have normal ping &amp;amp; SNMP responses.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Rebooting the switch might fix it, but that seems risky -- if switch4 dies, it would take rigel, vega, and their VMs (including the rhinobee.com webserver, odo database VM, and mail server) offline, requiring a visit to HE to replace or bypass the switch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;* We should plan / schedule a time when David or Kevin (or HE staff?) can be on site at HE, so that the switch can be replaced (or bypassed) quickly if it dies on reboot.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;________&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notes / specific symptoms:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;switch4 responds very slowly to snmpwalks, and then it consistently stops responding / times out before the snmpwalk finishes, ending with&lt;br&gt;"Timeout: No Response from 216.218.199.4"&lt;br&gt;That's causing MRTG cfgmaker to fail to generate a cfg for it (so I'm not able to add it to MRTG).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When pinging switch4 from our office, or from rigel (which is plugged directly into the switch in question), ping response times consistently alternate between very high, and very low, like so:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;root@horus66~ # ping switch4.bigbiz.com&lt;br&gt;PING switch4.bigbiz.com (216.218.199.4): 56 data bytes&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=0 ttl=63 time=4.908 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=1 ttl=63 time=190.795 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=2 ttl=63 time=6.300 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=3 ttl=63 time=201.036 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=4 ttl=63 time=6.752 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=5 ttl=63 time=200.474 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=6 ttl=63 time=5.322 ms&lt;br&gt;64 bytes from 216.218.199.4: icmp_seq=7 ttl=63 time=201.881 ms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;switch3.bigbiz.com has no such problems, only switch4.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-IR 4/22/2023&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;	1486	3	2023-04-29	2	\N	2023-04-22 15:34:46.65069-07	Ian	2023-04-22 15:42:29.469636-07	Ian	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
