he Main House&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi AP AC Mesh at the Kitchen Area in the Main House&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi AP AC Mesh at the Pool Area&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi Switch - 8Port PoE at the Garage&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi Switch Flex in Pool House&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - NanoStation 5AC LOCO Link from Main house Courtyard to the Guest house.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Scheduled Service Call for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;Network upgrade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;WiFi Upgrade Day 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 700;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Thursday 8.10.23 @ 9-10AM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Job summary&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Provided WiFi Coverage for the Courtyard and Guesthouse&lt;br&gt;* Replaced Network devices to provide better mapping and monitoring.&lt;br&gt;* Final tests and Mapping&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;* Installed the following devices:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi AP nano-HD in Guest House&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi Switch - 8Port PoE at the Kitchen Rack&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi Switch - 8Port PoE at the Court Yard&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; - UniFi AP AC Mesh at the Courtyard&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;AL 8.11.2023&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;_________________________________________________&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Billing:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;! - ***Please reach out to Gae